  7639.342517.. / 9639.342517.. -> differ, "$7,639.34" / "$9,639.34"
  0.004 / -0.004        -> differ, "$0.00" / "-$0.00" (formatMoney's
    negative-zero string differs from positive-zero string for a sub-cent
    negative input; wording "differ" is CORRECT because the two rendered
    strings genuinely differ; formatMoney itself is untouched by this diff
