  1000000.005 / 1000000.015 -> differ, "$1,000,000.01" / "$1,000,000.02"
  999999.995 / 1000000.005  -> differ, "$999,999.99" / "$1,000,000.01"
    (confirms formatMoney has no $1M abbreviation threshold for these
    fields — grep confirmed formatMoney never abbreviates; abbreviation
